	(text "Function: HDMI 5 carries recording (3/5), 32 MHz clock (6/8), command with SYNC (9/11),\nJTAG, sense and 5 V; 12/14 separate SYNC (LVDS). U805/U813 shunt data-line ESD; shell is bonded to DGND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 163.29 1113.25 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "07d43954-ff90-4f5b-bcb9-f6d9b4940ecd"))
	(text "Function: HDMI1 selects shared JTAG and VREF.\n100R series parts alone do not provide 5 V protection." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 163.34 791.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0ed9fded-7825-4d17-8496-febf0177f889"))
	(text "Source / changes: Codex custom interface; Molex 467651001 SD-46765-001 sheets 1-2:\nhttps://www.molex.com/content/dam/molex/molex-dot-com/products/automated/en-us/salesdrawingpdf/467/46765/467651001_sd.pdf?inline=\nXEM connector pin list: https://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310\nJ611: 3/5 MGT_RXP1_224/N (recording in, C747/C748 at MC3); 6/8 B64_L19P/N clock and 9/11 B64_L3P/N command+SYNC,\nLVDS from 1.8 V bank 64 (no GT command: Howard, routing).\n12/14 not connected (no SYNC on this port; V43, Howard 7 Nov 2026: clean up the rest). V33 (Howard 6 Nov 2026).\nU802/U810 TI TPD4E02B04 SLVSD85B Rev B secs. 5, 6.6, 8.2, 10: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpd4e02b04.pdf\nU802 IO1-4 = HDMI 3/5/9/11; U810 (mirrored) IO4/IO3 = 6/8; IO2/IO1 not connected; flow-through pads tied to their IO\n(SLVSD85B p3); all GND pins to DGND. Direct shell bond assumes a common-ground bench system.\nConnector, cable, SI, ESD layout/strike and enclosure need verification." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 449.04 905.85 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fd8e891-5ca1-4ed0-a114-428f09924fef"))
	
	(text "Source / changes: Codex custom interface; Molex 467651001 SD-46765-001 sheets 1-2:\nhttps://www.molex.com/content/dam/molex/molex-dot-com/products/automated/en-us/salesdrawingpdf/467/46765/467651001_sd.pdf?inline=\nXEM connector pin list: https://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310\nJ616: 3/5 MGT_RXP2_226/N (recording in, C757/C758 at MC3); 6/8 B64_L10P/N clock and 9/11 B64_L9P/N command+SYNC,\nLVDS from 1.8 V bank 64 (no GT command: Howard, routing).\n12/14 not connected (no SYNC on this port; V43, Howard 7 Nov 2026: clean up the rest). V33 (Howard 6 Nov 2026).\nU807/U815 TI TPD4E02B04 SLVSD85B Rev B secs. 5, 6.6, 8.2, 10: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpd4e02b04.pdf\nU807 IO1-4 = HDMI 3/5/9/11; U815 (mirrored) IO4/IO3 = 6/8; IO2/IO1 not connected; flow-through pads tied to their IO\n(SLVSD85B p3); all GND pins to DGND. Direct shell bond assumes a common-ground bench system.\nConnector, cable, SI, ESD layout/strike and enclosure need verification." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 734.79 1121.75 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "17b8839c-e044-448c-bcb4-4a80f2e4e8bd"))
