	(text "Source / changes: Codex custom interface; Molex 467651001 SD-46765-001 sheets 1-2:\nhttps://www.molex.com/content/dam/molex/molex-dot-com/products/automated/en-us/salesdrawingpdf/467/46765/467651001_sd.pdf?inline=\nXEM connector pin list: https://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310\nJ617: 3/5 MGT_RXP3_226/N (recording in, C759/C760 at MC3); 6/8 B64_L24P/N clock and 9/11 B64_L21P/N command+SYNC,\nLVDS from 1.8 V bank 64 (no GT command: Howard, routing).\n12/14 not connected (no SYNC on this port; V43, Howard 7 Nov 2026: clean up the rest). V33 (Howard 6 Nov 2026).\nU808/U816 TI TPD4E02B04 SLVSD85B Rev B secs. 5, 6.6, 8.2, 10: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpd4e02b04.pdf\nU808 IO1-4 = HDMI 3/5/9/11; U816 (mirrored) IO4/IO3 = 6/8; IO2/IO1 not connected; flow-through pads tied to their IO\n(SLVSD85B p3); all GND pins to DGND. Direct shell bond assumes a common-ground bench system.\nConnector, cable, SI, ESD layout/strike and enclosure need verification." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 1020.54 1121.75 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "256b7c6b-6bf0-42aa-8287-590c3901615a"))
	(text "USB-C JTAG PROGRAMMER, SELECTION AND FRONTEND PORTS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 42 253 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2b00ec54-1004-424d-8460-f1ba11f69836"))
	(text "Function: U700 converts +VDCIN to FE_5V (5.02 V nominal, 6 A module rating).\nPG and R703 enable all eight ports once the central rail is in regulation.\n\nSource / changes: TI TPSM63606 SLVSGB4B Rev. B, Fig. 9-1 and Table 8-1,\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpsm63606.pdf . Codex adapted prior V14 U100:\nR700 40.2k, R701 10k, R702 13k (all 1%), C708 22pF set 5 V / 1 MHz; PG gates switches.\nC700-C703 10uF / 50V; C704-C707 use 47uF / 16V X5R instead of prior X6S.\nCBOOT/RBOOT shorted, VLDOIN tied to output. Check effective capacitance,\nloop stability, input damping, startup, thermal performance and PCB layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 830.58 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2f9771d8-fcb8-45da-8618-30b42647fad8")
	)
	(text "Source / changes: Codex circuit using TI TS3A27518E Rev F Fig.5-2, Table 8-1:\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/ts3a27518e.pdf\nIN1/IN2 high select NO; active-low EN from rotary; 10k pullup.\nChannels (Howard 1 Nov 2026, for straight PCB routing):\nTCK=4, TDI=6, TMS=3, TDO=5, VREF=2; channel 1 unused.\nNO2-NO6: ±6 kV IEC contact rating; not a 5 V DC clamp.\nSelection, leakage, power-off and SI need checks." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 1020.59 1011.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "35ad37b6-269b-43e0-8652-e63a78fa2e52"))
	(text "USB TO JTAG PROGRAMMER" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 572.77 267.97 0) (effects (font (size 3.3 3.3) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3cea1992-00ac-4911-9ae4-c73482d1995f"))
	(text "Source / changes: Codex custom interface; Molex 467651001 SD-46765-001 sheets 1-2:\nhttps://www.molex.com/content/dam/molex/molex-dot-com/products/automated/en-us/salesdrawingpdf/467/46765/467651001_sd.pdf?inline=\nXEM connector pin list: https://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310\nJ612: 3/5 MGT_RXP2_224/N (recording in, C749/C750 at MC3); 6/8 B64_L13P_GC/N clock and 9/11 B64_L7P/N command+SYNC,\nLVDS from 1.8 V bank 64 (no GT command: Howard, routing).\n12/14 separate SYNC on B64_L16P/N (LVDS, bank 64; V36 (Howard 7 Nov 2026)). V33 (Howard 6 Nov 2026).\nU803/U811 TI TPD4E02B04 SLVSD85B Rev B secs. 5, 6.6, 8.2, 10: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpd4e02b04.pdf\nU803 IO1-4 = HDMI 3/5/9/11; U811 (mirrored) IO4/3/2/1 = 6/8/12/14 (12/14 SYNC); flow-through pads tied to their IO\n(SLVSD85B p3); all GND pins to DGND. Direct shell bond assumes a common-ground bench system.\nConnector, cable, SI, ESD layout/strike and enclosure need verification." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 734.79 905.85 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3f1e41c1-d39a-44f8-aeb7-3fc17df256f4"))
	
	
