	(text "Function: U701-U708 individually switch FE_5V to J610-J617 pin 19; red LEDs indicate each switch FAULT. TP701-TP708 access the outputs. All ports start together; no staggering.\nSource / changes: TI TPS2553 SLVS841G Rev. G, pins / sections 8-9 and Table 9-2: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps2553.pdf . Codex adapted prior V14: EN now follows U700 PG;\nR711-R718 = 37.4k 1% (630-771 mA limit); C711-C718 are IN bypass; V31: C721-C728 1 uF (Samsung CL10A105KB8NNNC, LCSC C15849) added on each OUT / PORTn_5V per SLVS841G sec. 9.2.1.2.4 p. 21 and the p. 1 ESD rating with external capacitance; value chosen by Claude, not given by TI; R721-R728 / D701-D708 added as FAULT lights. Each OUT goes to a separate pin-19 net.\nCable current and return rating, hot-plug / ESD, backfeed, 8-port inrush and thermal behavior are not verified. Existing 3.3 V-only frontends must NOT be connected to these 5 V ports.\nV40 (Howard, 20 Nov 2026, JLC stock, Claude): R711-R718 Yageo RC0603FR-0737K4L (JLC C163425, 45 in stock and all reserved) -> Yageo AC0603FR-0737K4L (JLC C227846), same 37.4k 1 % 0603 100 mW thick film, same footprint and limit: https://jlcpcb.com/partdetail/C227846 ; Yageo AC-series datasheet not read."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 586.74 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "736408b0-862b-4f8b-b22b-ae5ad19c9316")
	)
	
	
	(text "Source / changes: Codex circuit using TI TS3A27518E Rev F Fig.5-2, Table 8-1:\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/ts3a27518e.pdf\nIN1/IN2 high select NO; active-low EN from rotary; 10k pullup.\nChannels (Howard 1 Nov 2026, for straight PCB routing):\nTCK=4, TDI=6, TMS=3, TDO=5, VREF=2; channel 1 unused.\nNO2-NO6: ±6 kV IEC contact rating; not a 5 V DC clamp.\nSelection, leakage, power-off and SI need checks." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 163.34 795.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7995acb5-30be-4973-8512-cef11275c35b"))
	
