(text "1. Function: ties VREFP (MC2.79) to GNDADC (MC2.77), which selects\nthe FPGA internal ADC reference.\n\n2. Source / changes: Opal Kelly XEM8310 Hardware Design Guide,\nSelecting the ADC Reference Voltage, revision not stated:\nhttps://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8310/hardware-design-guide/\nBRK8310-A01 SYSMON Header R6 = 0 ohm is a direct wire here.\nADC readings are not verified on hardware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180 171.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "11f7102e-59c6-4e28-8d79-51281a969e66"))
