	(text "Function: bare oscilloscope probe pads for testing this board on its own: the 1.8 V JTAG bus (TCK, TMS, TDI, TDO),\nthe FTDI-side TCK and TDO, the target-sense chain (VREF_SELECTED, WINDOW_GATE, DRIVE_ENABLE), USB-C VBUS,\nPORT_ENABLE and VIO_PG. Each has a DGND pad 1.6-4.4 mm away for a short ground spring. Locations: PROBE_MAP.csv." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 1867.82 326.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a42057de-3c74-41e3-9a2d-a229f3c76742"))
	(text "Source / changes: designed by Claude for bring-up probing (Howard, 18 Nov 2026: probe pads so each board can be\ntested on its own); no manufacturer reference circuit. V39 adds TP720-TP739 on existing nets only (no net added or\nrenamed, no part moved). Pads sit on existing copper, except 0.8-1.7 mm stubs to TP727/TP729/TP736 and a new\nDGND via under TP725 and TP728. LVDS, GT, PCIe and USB pairs get no pad: probe them at the J61x pins, ESD parts or\nAC capacitors listed in PROBE_MAP.csv. Probe loading on the JTAG lines has not been measured." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 1867.82 337.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ed176090-7cb6-47a1-8f96-9cd93a392118"))
